START

Set the secret word
Set guessed letters to empty
Set wrong guesses to 0

Display the first Hangman image
Display the hidden word
Create buttons for A–Z

WHEN the player selects a letter:

    IF the letter was already guessed:
        do nothing

    ELSE:
        add the letter to guessed letters
        disable the letter button

        IF the letter is in the secret word:
            reveal the matching letters

        ELSE:
            increase wrong guesses
            display the next Hangman stage

        Check if all letters have been revealed

        IF the word is complete:
            display a win message
            end the game

        ELSE IF maximum wrong guesses is reached:
            display a loss message
            end the game

END